#: plugins/mqtt/src/plugin.vala:1337
msgid ""
"ℹ Server: ejabberd (mod_mqtt detected)\n"
"\n"
"ejabberd shares XMPP and MQTT authentication.\n"
"You can use your XMPP credentials to connect\n"
"to the MQTT broker on the same domain.\n"
"\n"
"Per-account mode uses these credentials automatically."
msgstr ""
"ℹ Servidor: ejabberd (mod_mqtt detectat)\n"
"\n"
"ejabberd comparteix l'autenticació XMPP i MQTT.\n"
"Podeu utilitzar les vostres credencials XMPP per connectar-vos\n"
"al servidor MQTT del mateix domini.\n"
"\n"
"El mode per compte utilitza aquestes credencials automàticament."

#: plugins/mqtt/src/plugin.vala:1345
msgid ""
"⚠ Server: Prosody (mod_pubsub_mqtt detected)\n"
"\n"
"Prosody's MQTT bridge does NOT support authentication.\n"
"Any client on the network can subscribe to topics.\n"
"\n"
"Recommendations:\n"
"• Restrict MQTT port via firewall\n"
"• Use TLS for encryption\n"
"• Do not publish sensitive data\n"
"\n"
"Topic format: <HOST>/<TYPE>/<NODE>"
msgstr ""
"⚠ Servidor: Prosody (mod_pubsub_mqtt detectat)\n"
"\n"
"El pont MQTT de Prosody NO admet autenticació.\n"
"Qualsevol client de la xarxa es pot subscriure als temes.\n"
"\n"
"Recomanacions:\n"
"• Restringiu el port MQTT amb un tallafoc\n"
"• Utilitzeu TLS per al xifratge\n"
"• No publiqueu dades sensibles\n"
"\n"
"Format del tema: <HOST>/<TYPE>/<NODE>"

